Cat Clip Composer 0.1.26

- Restores full-length scrollbars and compacts context-menu detail gutters.
- Keeps live overlay proxies at their configured opacity and marks stale moved content.
- Reorganizes effect editors and adds background-aware native overlay frame previews.
- Adds cached LQ preview resolution presets plus explicit Frame LQ and Frame HQ actions.
- Improves dark tooltips and baseline hover help across interactive controls.
